1
00:00:00,045 --> 00:00:03,545
(Raj:)I bought him dinner and we kissed once.
That was it.

2
00:00:04,091 --> 00:00:06,681
And he told me his name was Kimberly.

3
00:00:11,223 --> 00:00:14,603
(Sheldon:)You know how I know
we're not in the Matrix?

4
00:00:18,105 --> 00:00:19,395
(Leonard:)How?

5
00:00:19,898 --> 00:00:23,148
(Sheldon:)If we were, the food would be better.

6
00:00:24,236 --> 00:00:25,406
(Leslie(arriving):)Hey, Leonard.

7
00:00:25,571 --> 00:00:28,321
- Hey, Leslie.
- Hey, dummy.

8
00:00:28,699 --> 00:00:32,749
(Sheldon:)Hello to you,
insufficiently intelligent person.

9
00:00:33,203 --> 00:00:35,993
(Leslie:)Ooh, rush me to the Burn Unit.

10
00:00:38,625 --> 00:00:40,915
Do you have a second?
I need to ask you something.

11
00:00:41,086 --> 00:00:43,466
- Yeah, sure.
- Well, if you'll excuse me...

12
00:00:43,630 --> 00:00:47,090
(Sheldon:)...I'm going to go do work
that promises significant results...

13
00:00:47,259 --> 00:00:51,389
(Sheldon:)...as opposed to what you do,
which does not.

14
00:00:52,389 --> 00:01:06,029
(Sheldon:)Yeah, you heard me.

